Add LLM-powered mitigations using Cohere API

## Summary
Integrated Cohere's LLM to generate intelligent, context-aware security
mitigations instead of hardcoded recommendations. The system now analyzes
complete penetration test results and produces tailored mitigation strategies
specific to each scan's findings.

## What Changed

### New Features
- LLM service module for Cohere API integration
- Smart prompt engineering from scan data (findings, ports, files, attacks)
- Response parsing and cleanup (strips markdown, formatting)
- Graceful fallback to static mitigations if LLM unavailable
- Pipeline step 5.5: AI mitigation generation

