## How It Works

Pipeline flow:
```
Recon → AI Analysis → Attack Planning → Build JSON
  → LLM Mitigations (NEW) → Generate Report
```

Before (static):
```python
mitigations = [
  "Implement least privilege",
  "Close unnecessary ports",
  "Encrypt sensitive files"
]
```

After (AI-powered):
```python
mitigations = [
  "Restrict MySQL port 3306 to internal network using firewall rules",
  "Enable authentication on Jenkins and implement RBAC",
  "Rotate SSH keys in /home/admin/.ssh/ and use cert-based auth",
  "Migrate credentials from database.yml to secrets manager (Vault)"
]
```

## Setup

```bash
# Install Cohere SDK
pip install cohere==5.13.5

# Set API key (get from https://dashboard.cohere.com/)
export COHERE_API_KEY="your-key-here"

# Test
python3 tests/test_llm_mitigations.py
```

